cff-version: 1.2.0
title: CNS Drug Dictionary Framework
message: >-
  If you use this software or the reference dictionary, please cite the
  preprint below.
type: software
version: 4.0.0
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: https://github.com/LucasMitre-droid/CNS_Drug_Dictionary_Framework
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of a drug-specific, half-life-adjusted framework for
  classifying concurrent and adjuvant CNS-active systemic therapy exposure
  around radiotherapy. Extends the published single-dose exposure window with a
  compounding steady-state half-life, a dose-level coverage rule, and a sweep
  over the definition grid.
keywords:
  - brain metastases
  - radiotherapy
  - CNS-active systemic therapy
  - pharmacokinetics
  - exposure classification
  - reproducibility
